<text top="531" left="548" width="5" height="12" font="117"><b>+</b></text>
<text top="534" left="553" width="166" height="14" font="99">，協助強積金成員在退休前累積儲備。</text>
<text top="534" left="719" width="2" height="12" font="117"><b> </b></text>
<text top="547" left="45" width="806" height="12" font="117"><b>Sun Life MPF Income Fund aims to provide stable payouts+ (dividend amount/yield is not guaranteed and dividends may be paid out of / effectively out of capital) while reinvesting to </b></text>
<text top="558" left="45" width="451" height="12" font="117"><b>foster long-term capital growth+, aiming to help MPF members accumulate savings before retirement.</b></text>
